{"id":"658577","name":"蚝油豆腐","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658577/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"500g"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"10g"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆腐切厚块。","img":"images/658577/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉末、蒜末、葱花。","img":"images/658577/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"碗中放入蚝油、豆瓣酱、酱油、老抽，加适量的清水拌匀。","img":"images/658577/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"淀粉、胡椒粉加适量清水调个芡汁。","img":"images/658577/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧油，炒香蒜末和肉粒。","img":"images/658577/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入水煮开。","img":"images/658577/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入豆腐，加入适量的盐入味。","img":"images/658577/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入酱汁。","img":"images/658577/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖盖煮3分钟。","img":"images/658577/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"时间到，倒入芡汁。","img":"images/658577/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"汤汁煮至浓稠，加入葱花即可。","img":"images/658577/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658577/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}